OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for seven accused
OL,4,Aof vandalism at Trump Turnberry
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people are to stand trial in 2028
OL,7,Faccused of vandalising US President
OL,8,FDonald Trump's Turnberry golf resort.
OL,10,FKieran Robson, 35, Uzma Bashir, 56,
OL,11,FRicky Southall, 34, Autumn Ward, 23,
OL,12,FRebecca Sian Davies, 29, John Moxley,
OL,13,F58, and Dylan Chiaramello, 25, are
OL,14,Fsuspected of causing "malicious
OL,15,Fmischief" during a protest on 8 March
OL,16,Flast year.
OL,18,FProsecutors claim the allegation will
OL,19,Fbe proved in terms of section 31 of the
OL,20,FCounter-Terrorism Act 2008 and said the
OL,21,Fcharge is aggravated by having a
OL,22,F"terrorist connection".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
